{"id":"n62090-3-5","stage":3,"title":"벌어지다 · 展现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62090-3-5-1","ko":"오늘 뉴스에서 미국에 허리케인 부는 거 봤어?","zh":"今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뉴스에서","meaning":"新闻","explanation":"뉴스：新闻；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"뉴스","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32795","senseId":"1","lemma":"뉴스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미국에","meaning":"美国","explanation":"미국：美国；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"미국에","audio":"/audio/985bce1e4d8dcb822374.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"허리케인","meaning":"飓风","explanation":"허리케인：飓风","readings":[{"term":"허리케인","audio":"/audio/26fb16043df220ca2b34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:허리케인:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리케인","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"부는","meaning":"刮，吹","explanation":"불다：刮，吹；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"불다","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74179","senseId":"1","lemma":"불다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"受，获","explanation":"보다：受，获；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"26","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"5ac661dbed5720ae","term":"뉴스","zh":"新闻","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3","entryId":"32795","definition":"报道新消息的电视、广播节目。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"26fb16043df220ca","term":"허리케인","zh":"飓风","audio":"/audio/26fb16043df220ca2b34.mp3","definition":"发生于大西洋等地区的强烈热带气旋。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1389fa35feb8849f","term":"불다","zh":"刮，吹","audio":"/audio/1389fa35feb8849f522f.mp3","entryId":"74179","definition":"风起而向某个方向移动。","pronunciation":["불ː다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"受，获","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"遭遇或经历某个事情，或获取某物。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d2808895222efefd2899.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62090-3-5-2","ko":"응. 영화에서만 보던 그런 광경이 벌어졌어.","zh":"嗯。那种只在电影里见过的景象真的出现了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화에서만","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보던","meaning":"(做)过","explanation":"보다：(做)过；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"광경이","meaning":"景象，情景，情境","explanation":"광경：景象，情景，情境；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"광경","audio":"/audio/e04a3692fa41fb1e447a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24003","senseId":"1","lemma":"광경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌어졌어.","meaning":"展现，出现","explanation":"벌어지다：展现，出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"벌어지다","audio":"/audio/b6aba93582fa799f6e42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62090","senseId":"3","lemma":"벌어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"(做)过","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示经历过前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"e04a3692fa41fb1e","term":"광경","zh":"景象，情景，情境","audio":"/audio/e04a3692fa41fb1e447a.mp3","entryId":"24003","definition":"某些事情或现象发生的场面或样子。","pronunciation":["광경"]},{"id":"b6aba93582fa799f","term":"벌어지다","zh":"展现，出现","audio":"/audio/b6aba93582fa799f6e42.mp3","entryId":"62090","definition":"某事发生的状况或情形在眼前展开。","pronunciation":["버ː러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd598986f3d60b477322.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.736,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62090","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4613,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。那种只在电影里见过的景象真的出现了。","听说承奎又没考上大学呢。","今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。那种只在电影里见过的景象真的出现了。","今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？","